{"4861740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Timekeeper", "steam_appid": 4861740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4862260], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the next TIMEKEEPER and defend the flow of history.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When his father passes away, Jack, a humble young farmer, discovers a life-changing secret: he is destined to become the next <strong>TIMEKEEPER</strong>, guardian of the timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of <strong>CITI</strong>, he embarks on an adventure across centuries to stop the evil <strong>Goran</strong>, a powerful force determined to alter history and change the fate of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different eras, encounter memorable characters, fight formidable enemies, and restore the timeline before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with the <strong>History Book</strong>, Jack can track changes in the timeline and uncover which events have been altered. Using the <strong>TimeWatch</strong>, he receives three possible missions whenever history is disrupted—but only one of them will truly restore the timeline. Choose wisely, as every decision can shape the course of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861740/extras/b709e0494a921f65375010b2fa2511c9.poster.avif?t=1784738276\" aria-label=\"History Book and Timewatch\" width=1170 height=694 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861740/extras/b709e0494a921f65375010b2fa2511c9.webm?t=1784738276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861740/extras/b709e0494a921f65375010b2fa2511c9.mp4?t=1784738276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master four unique tools and abilities throughout your journey:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boomerang</strong> – Hit distant targets and solve environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bow</strong> – Strike enemies and switches from afar with precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grapple Hook</strong> – Cross gaps, reach hidden areas, and navigate dangerous terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb</strong> – Destroy obstacles, reveal secrets, and overcome powerful challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861740/extras/9ac2f937fc2b4ec5bc44f622c3b02872.poster.avif?t=1784738276\" aria-label=\"Abilities boomerang, grappling hook, bow &amp;amp; arrows and bombs.\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861740/extras/9ac2f937fc2b4ec5bc44f622c3b02872.webm?t=1784738276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861740/extras/9ac2f937fc2b4ec5bc44f622c3b02872.mp4?t=1784738276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perform special actions:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash to avoid enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the super attack to make more damage</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw objects at enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861740/extras/89872ae5c024f384dc0e0bb6ec65a631.poster.avif?t=1784738276\" aria-label=\"Dash, power attack, throw objects\" width=666 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861740/extras/89872ae5c024f384dc0e0bb6ec65a631.webm?t=1784738276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861740/extras/89872ae5c024f384dc0e0bb6ec65a631.mp4?t=1784738276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through time, solve puzzles, battle dangerous foes, escape dungeons and become the hero history needs before the timeline is lost forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861740/extras/162a09f019cc9e41e3b2652e7934a3ed.poster.avif?t=1784738276\" aria-label=\"Puzzles, dungeons\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861740/extras/162a09f019cc9e41e3b2652e7934a3ed.webm?t=1784738276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4861740/extras/162a09f019cc9e41e3b2652e7934a3ed.mp4?t=1784738276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I use no AI to code this game. &quot;I only used it to make the black logo.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer:</i> I didn't know anything about coding a game. I learnt with Michael Games youtube videos. At first, the goal was to make some levels to showcase my music. But as I went further and further in coding, I decided to finish the game. It's not a high tier game, but I think it's a funny one. If you find bugsm please reach to me, I'll try my best to fix them. I'm no historian too. There may be some inaccuracy in the story. Please take that in consideration before leaving a comment, that would be appreciated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>